### Create a land
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lands
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Landing page campaign",
  "canvas": {
    "version": 1,
    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "hero-title",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 120,
        "y": 96,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 80,
      }
    ],
    "appstate": { "backgroundColor": "#ffffff" }
  }
}

### List my lands
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lands?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Save a new immutable revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lands/{{landId}}/revisions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "canvas": { "elements": [{ "id": "hero" }] }
}

### Download the current canvas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lands/{{landId}}/canvas
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Restore a retained revision (creates a new revision)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lands/{{landId}}/revisions/1/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
